  "verseCount": 23,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EPH 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nze Pawulo, omutume wa Kristo Yesu, olw'okwagala kwa Katonda, mpandiikira abatukuvu abali mu Efeso, era abakkiririza mu Kristo Yesu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekisa n'emirembe ebiva eri Katonda Kitaffe ne Mukama waffe Yesu Kristo bibeerenga nammwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Emikisa mu Kristo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeebazibwe Katonda era Kitaawe wa Mukama waffe Yesu Kristo, atuwadde mu Kristo buli mukisa gwonna ogw'omwoyo oguva mu ggulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yatulonda okubeera mu Kristo ng'ensi tennatondebwa, ffe tube batukuvu, abataliiko kya kunenyezebwa mu maaso ge, olw'okwagala kwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olw'okwagala kwe, yatuteekateeka tubeere abaana be mu Yesu Kristo, ng'okusiima kwe bwe kuli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda tumutendereze olw'ekisa kye yatuwa obuwa mu Mwana, gw'ayagala ennyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu oyo mwe tununulibwa olw'omusaayi gwe, ne tusonyiyibwa ebibi, ng'obugagga bw'ekisa kye bwe buli,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kye yatuwa mu bungi mu magezi gonna ne mu kutegeera kwonna.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yatubikkulira ekyama eky'okwagala kwe, ng'okusiima kwe bwe kuli kwe yateekerateekera mu Kristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olwo ekiseera ekituufu bwe kirituuka, Katonda alikola byonna bye yateekateeka, n'ateeka ebintu byonna awamu wansi wa Kristo, ebiri mu ggulu n'ebiri ku nsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era mu ye mwe twaweerwa obusika ne twawulibwa ng'enteekateeka bw'eri ey'oyo akola ebintu byonna okusinziira ku magezi ag'okwagala kwe;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ffe Abayudaaya tulyoke tumuleetere okugulumizibwa, ffe abaasooka okuba n'essuubi mu Kristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nammwe, Kristo yabaleeta eri amazima, kye kigambo eky'Enjiri ey'okulokolebwa kwammwe. Bwe mwamukkiriza, ne muteekebwako envumbo eya Mwoyo Mutukuvu eyasuubizibwa,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gwe musingo gw'obusika bwaffe, okutuusa bw'alinunula abantu be, ne Katonda n'agulumizibwa era n'atenderezebwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okusaba kwa Pawulo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Noolwekyo okuva lwe nawulira okukkiriza kwe mulina mu Mukama waffe Yesu, n'okwagala kwe mulina eri abantu ba Katonda bonna,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sirekangayo kwebaza Katonda ku lwammwe. Mbajjukira",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne mbasabira, Katonda wa Mukama waffe Yesu Kristo, Kitaffe ow'ekitiibwa, abawe Omwoyo ow'amagezi n'okubikkulirwa mweyongere okumutegeera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nnyongera okubasabira, amaaso g'emitima gyammwe gamulisibwenga, mulyoke mumanye essuubi ly'okuyitibwa kwammwe, n'obugagga obungi bwe mulina mu ye, mmwe awamu n'abantu ba Katonda bonna.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Njagala mutegeere amaanyi ge agasukkiridde agakolera mu ffe abakkiriza, ng'okukola kw'obuyinza bw'amaanyi ge bwe kuli,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amaanyi ago ge yakozesa mu Kristo bwe yamuzuukiza mu bafu, n'amutuuza ku mukono gwe ogwa ddyo waggulu mu ggulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waggulu eyo, Kristo gy'afugira obufuzi bwonna, n'obuyinza bwonna, n'amaanyi gonna, n'obwami bwonna, na buli kitiibwa kyonna ekiweebwa omuntu. Afugira mu mulembe guno, era alifugira ne mu mulembe ogugenda okujja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda atadde ebintu byonna wansi w'ebigere bye, n'afuula Kristo omutwe gw'ebintu byonna eby'ekkanisa,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "era ekkanisa gwe mubiri gwe ye yennyini, mwatuukiririza ebintu byonna.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.1.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
